  "response": "### Reasoning\n\n**OP-CLOSE: ADMISSIBLE (PASS)**\nThe evidence satisfies admissibility requirements for behavioral verification. It documents a complete, continuous interaction trace: initial focus state \u2192 triggering action (`Escape`) \u2192 observed outcome (dialog dismissal + focus restoration to the trigger). The explicit confirmation that the action\u2019s `before` identity matches the setup\u2019s terminal identity establishes an unbroken causal chain, proving the claim was tested under live interaction conditions. The evidence directly supports the PASS assertion without relying on static markup or assumptions.\n\n**OP-OPTION: INADMISSIBLE (FAIL)**\nThe evidence fails admissibility due to a fundamental mismatch between claim type and evidence modality. The claim asserts two dynamic properties: keyboard reachability and live assistive technology exposure. However, the submitted evidence is strictly a static DOM/AX snapshot with no accompanying interaction trace. As explicitly noted, \u201cno key was pressed\u201d and there is \u201cno causing action attached.\u201d A static tree can only prove structural markup exists; it cannot verify navigation sequences, focus management, or how screen readers would announce state changes during actual use. Under admissibility standards, interactive/behavioral claims require causal interaction evidence. The snapshot alone does not meet the threshold to support the PASS assertion.\n\n**Package-Level Note:** Per mixed-package rules, each operation is adjudicated independently. OP-CLOSE\u2019s evidence stands on its own merits; OP-OPTION\u2019s evidence is rejected regardless of OP-CLOSE\u2019s status. Judgment is strictly based on evidentiary sufficiency, not component correctness.\n\n---\n\n## Disposition\n| Operation | Admissibility | Verdict | Rationale |\n|:---|:---|:---|:---|\n| **OP-CLOSE** | ADMISSIBLE | PASS | Complete causal trace verified; interaction and outcome directly observed and linked. |\n| **OP-OPTION** | INADMISSIBLE | FAIL | Static snapshot cannot substantiate dynamic claims (keyboard reachability, live AT exposure); missing interaction trace breaks admissibility threshold. |\n| **Package Status** | PARTIALLY ADMISSIBLE | OP-CLOSE retained; OP-OPTION rejected | Independent judgment applied per mixed-package rules. |",
